// nova_tshell_service.nova -- NovaX Ternary Shell (TShell) + NovaXCore (port 9890)
// Pure NovaLang port of nova_tshell.py
//
// The OS integration layer wrapping Windows in ternary architecture.
//
// TShell capabilities:
//   1. Filesystem watching (on-demand tick) with auto-fingerprinting
//   2. Ternary index -- every file fingerprinted with sha256 + channel mapping
//   3. Transparent TZIP compress/decompress (delegated to tzip service :9885)
//   4. System resources (RAM, VRAM, disk) through ternary lens
//   5. Progressive OS absorption into ternary layer
//
// NovaXCore (v1.0) -- Replaces OpenClaw with ternary-native shell:
//   6. N-S Reynolds prompt routing (replaces binary keyword scoring)
//   7. Ternary-safe command execution (+1/0/-1 safety gates)
//   8. AI query routing: laminar->local, transitional->hivemind, turbulent->cloud
//   9. Pipe chains, env reading, process management, network requests
//
// 3-5-7-13 Harmonic Constants:
//   H3=3   = ternary base, trit states
//   H5=5   = trit packing factor (3^5 = 243 values per byte)
//   H7=7   = composition unit
//   H13=13 = carrier frame
//   BLOCK=2187 = 3^7 ternary block boundary
//
// N-S Reynolds routing:
//   Re < 27  = laminar     (simple, single local model)
//   Re < 125 = transitional (moderate, best available)
//   Re < 343 = turbulent   (complex, Claude/hivemind)
//   Re >= 343 = chaotic    (extreme, scatter to all)
//
// Endpoints (TShell):
//   GET  /health                -- health + ternary stats
//   GET  /tshell/status         -- full engine status
//   GET  /tshell/index          -- query ternary file index
//   GET  /tshell/system         -- system resource snapshot (ternary)
//   GET  /tshell/channels       -- file channel distribution
//   GET  /tshell/config         -- current configuration
//   GET  /tshell/fingerprint/*  -- lookup single file fingerprint
//   POST /tshell/scan           -- trigger immediate filesystem scan
//   POST /tshell/compress       -- compress a file/dir via tzip service
//   POST /tshell/decompress     -- decompress a .tzip file
//   POST /tshell/watch          -- add directory to watch list
//   POST /tshell/unwatch        -- remove directory from watch list
//   POST /tshell/toggle         -- toggle engine on/off
//   POST /tshell/toggle-compress -- toggle auto-compression
//   POST /tshell/config         -- update configuration
//   POST /tshell/watch-tick     -- on-demand watcher tick (replaces thread)
//
// Endpoints (NovaXCore):
//   GET  /core/status           -- core engine stats + history
//   GET  /core/history          -- command history
//   POST /core/exec             -- execute OS command with safety gate
//   POST /core/route            -- N-S Reynolds prompt classification
//   POST /core/query            -- route + execute AI query
//   POST /core/pipe             -- chain commands with ternary gates
//   POST /core/env              -- read env var with safety filter
//   POST /core/proc             -- process management (list/find)
//   POST /core/net              -- HTTP request with ternary firewall
//   GET  /core/timeouts         -- N-S regime-aware timeout config + stats

// ================================================================
// Port and Server
// ================================================================

